1
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,118
Cookie time, friends!

2
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:19,595
Mr. Bumble baked star cookies for the garden party.

3
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:26,481
Twelve neighbors, twelve cookies. One for everyone!

4
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:31,688
And we put on the sparkly icing!

5
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:38,489
Oops! Now I'm a snowman!

6
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:53,717
Let's count them, so nobody gets left out.

7
00:00:57,350 --> 00:01:00,045
One, two, three, four, five, six...

8
00:01:04,350 --> 00:01:07,010
Seven, eight, nine, ten, eleven...

9
00:01:10,350 --> 00:01:12,221
Eleven? That's funny.

10
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:17,555
Did somebody take a cookie?

11
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:23,544
Not me!

12
00:01:28,350 --> 00:01:30,906
Pip, you have yellow on your nose...

13
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:37,771
That's icing! I didn't eat one.

14
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:45,176
Hmm. Then one neighbor won't get a cookie.

15
00:01:49,350 --> 00:01:52,379
Milo's tummy felt heavy and wiggly.

16
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:06,258
If I tell, they might be mad.

17
00:02:10,350 --> 00:02:13,880
I'd bake one more, but my flour is all gone.

18
00:02:17,350 --> 00:02:19,067
Someone will be left out.

19
00:02:24,350 --> 00:02:27,742
That heavy feeling has a name. It's guilt.

20
00:02:30,350 --> 00:02:33,746
Milo, you look like a cloud is sitting on you.

21
00:02:38,350 --> 00:02:41,671
Once, I broke my mom's teapot and hid it.

22
00:02:45,350 --> 00:02:49,547
My tummy felt heavy for days. Then I told her.

23
00:02:53,350 --> 00:02:57,032
And you know what? The truth feels lighter.

24
00:03:06,350 --> 00:03:08,291
What could Milo do?

25
00:03:27,350 --> 00:03:30,898
Mr. Bumble? Pip? I have to tell you something.

26
00:03:34,350 --> 00:03:36,831
I ate the cookie. It was me.

27
00:03:41,350 --> 00:03:44,370
And I said not me. That wasn't true.

28
00:03:48,350 --> 00:03:51,927
I'm sorry, Pip. You got blamed because of me.

29
00:03:55,350 --> 00:03:56,918
Thank you for telling.

30
00:04:01,350 --> 00:04:04,256
Hey... my tummy doesn't feel heavy anymore!

31
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:10,297
The truth feels lighter!

32
00:04:15,350 --> 00:04:18,025
Thank you, Milo. That was brave.

33
00:04:22,350 --> 00:04:25,371
Now, how do we fix the missing cookie?

34
00:04:29,350 --> 00:04:31,898
My house has flour! I'll get it!

35
00:04:51,350 --> 00:04:54,063
Ta-da! A very special star.

36
00:04:58,350 --> 00:05:00,594
Now you have icing on your nose!

37
00:05:05,350 --> 00:05:07,000
Ten, eleven...

38
00:05:07,350 --> 00:05:08,401
Twelve!

39
00:05:19,350 --> 00:05:22,835
One for every neighbor. Nobody left out.

40
00:05:26,350 --> 00:05:28,793
Thanks for being my friend, Pip.

41
00:05:40,350 --> 00:05:42,217
Ah... ah... CHOO!

42
00:05:47,350 --> 00:05:51,027
When I make a mistake, I'll tell the truth.

